    <bpmn:serviceTask id="Activity_0u9wp8c" name="RPA: Outlook Startup messen" zeebe:modelerTemplate="camunda.connectors.rpa" zeebe:modelerTemplateVersion="2" zeebe:modelerTemplateIcon="data:image/svg+xml;base64,">
      <bpmn:extensionElements>
        <zeebe:taskDefinition type="={&#10;  label: if (camundaRpaWorkerLabel = null or camundaRpaWorkerLabel = &#34;&#34;) then &#34;default&#34; else camundaRpaWorkerLabel,&#10;  baseName: &#34;camunda::RPA-Task::&#34;,&#10;  definitionType: baseName + label&#10;}.definitionType" retries="3" />
        <zeebe:ioMapping>
          <zeebe:input source="default" target="camundaRpaWorkerLabel" />
        </zeebe:ioMapping>
        <zeebe:taskHeaders>
          <zeebe:header key="retryBackoff" value="PT30S" />
        </zeebe:taskHeaders>
        <zeebe:properties>
